OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGig evacuation quarantine was          
OL,4,Atraumatic, fans say                    
OL,6,FHe said they had asked for medical help
OL,7,Fat 22:15 GMT and were taken to the     
OL,8,FEtihad Stadium and made to change into 
OL,9,Fpaper suits, before being released at  
OL,10,Fabout 04:45 on Monday.                 
OL,12,FGreater Manchester Police said:        
OL,13,F"People's safety, and the safety of the
OL,14,Fwider community, was at the forefront  
OL,15,Fof officers' minds throughout."        
